DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
16251::$$$message_0127_0000_0000$$$::"Oh, Shinji."[lr]::
16252::$$$message_0127_0000_0001$$$::Shinji is standing alone at the unpopulated port before 10 AM.[lr]::
16253::$$$message_0127_0000_0002$$$::"You fishing? ...I guess not."[lr]::
16254::$$$message_0127_0000_0003$$$::Shinji is gazing blankly at the sea empty-handed.::
16255::$$$message_0127_0001_0000$$$::"Hey, Shinji."[lr]::
16256::$$$message_0127_0001_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
16257::$$$message_0127_0001_0002$$$::"What are you doing? Are you waiting for someone?"[lr]::
16258::$$$message_0127_0001_0003$$$::"...Shut up, leave me alone.[lr]::
16259::$$$message_0127_0001_0004$$$::I'm just a disliked person. I have no screen time no matter where I go, I'm treated like a weirdo, and when I come to fish for a change of pace, I get approached by a weirdo!"::
16260::$$$message_0127_0002_0000$$$::"Hey Emiya, compared to Sakura who has a lot of screen time, I've only appeared three times.[lr]::
16261::$$$message_0127_0002_0001$$$::Wow, isn't it weird that I can count the number of times on one hand? First of all, there isn't a single little sister who's better than her big brother!"[wvs][clfg textoff=0 pos=all rule=シャッター左から time=400]::
16262::$$$message_0127_0003_0000$$$::Shinji moves to the side of the port.[lr]::
16263::$$$message_0127_0003_0001$$$::...He must seriously be freaking out for him to be crouching like a roly-poly.[lr]::
16264::$$$message_0127_0003_0002$$$::If he had a cardboard box, he probably would put it over his head.[lr]::
16265::$$$message_0127_0003_0003$$$::I can't help but cry at how negative he's being.::
16266::$$$message_0127_0004_0000$$$::"Wha[line len=2]Don't be ridiculous. Don't lose, Shinji. Stand up, Shinji![lr]::
16267::$$$message_0127_0004_0001$$$::I thought it was your strength to not notice your unfair treatment at all and not try to read the room one bit...!"[lr]::
16268::$$$message_0127_0004_0002$$$::I cheer him on impulse too.::
16269::$$$message_0127_0005_0000$$$::"...No thanks, I'm tired. I have a spiteful personality to start with, since I got the correct Matou genes.[lr]::
16270::$$$message_0127_0005_0001$$$::So my grandfather, my old man, and my old man's little brother suited being distressed on the side like this." ::
16271::$$$message_0127_0006_0000$$$::Shinji shuts himself off even more.[lr]::
16272::$$$message_0127_0006_0001$$$::Well, I think Shinji is a great guy after all for retreating to a place with such a great view.::
16273::$$$message_0127_0007_0000$$$::"...It's fine, so can you just go away?[lr]::
16274::$$$message_0127_0007_0001$$$::I'm waiting for my soulmate.[lr]::
16275::$$$message_0127_0007_0002$$$::This is my last chance to become the main character.[lr]::
16276::$$$message_0127_0007_0003$$$::I don't have any business with you since you came empty-handed."[lr]::
16277::$$$message_0127_0007_0004$$$::He shoos me away.::
16278::$$$message_0127_0008_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
16279::$$$message_0127_0008_0001$$$::Hmm. I feel like there's nothing that I can do right now.[lr]::
16280::$$$message_0127_0008_0002$$$::I should come again later if I feel like it.::
916254::$$$message_9127_0000_0003$$$::Shinji is gazing blankly at the sea empty-handed.[r]��